  "subdivision_of_building": "Roof: Alteration to the existing roof structure to accommodate the loft floor and application of new external finishes\nLoft Floor: Creation of a new habitable level (a bedroom and associated spaces) within the roof space\nFirst Floor: Alterations to the existing floor plan to incorporate the new staircase leading up to the second-floor habitable space.",
  "status": "Lapsed",
  "description": "The proposed works involve converting the unused attic space (loft) of the dwelling into a new habitable room by adding a dormer. The new space will create  a bedroom and an ensuite. This change requires installing a permanent new staircase to connect the first floor to the new living space upstairs.\nThis dormer will be finished to blend in with the house. The material finish of the dormer facade will be tiles matching the roof, and the main roof will be completed with new clay tiles to match the existing roof tiles. ",
